{"id":"wb-5-416","name":"仓颉墓与庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"仓颉墓与庙","text":"仓颉墓与庙位于中国陕西省渭南市白水县史官镇杨武村。2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n为中国传说时代人物仓颉的墓与庙。始建年代不详，传说汉代已有墓冢，宋代曾对墓庙维修，明清多次维修。建筑群坐北朝南，前庙后墓，中轴线上依次为照壁、山门、献殿、正殿、寝殿、墓园，两侧有戏楼、厢房、钟鼓楼。正殿面阔五间，进深三间，硬山顶。寝殿为主体建筑，面阔五间，具有元代建筑风格。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BB%93%E9%A2%89%E5%A2%93%E4%B8%8E%E5%BA%99","revisionId":94470654,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94470654","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f92b4c93ae400a6742c0e252.jpg","title":"仓颉墓门口_-_Doorway_of_Cangjie_Tomb.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%BB%93%E9%A2%89%E5%A2%93%E9%97%A8%E5%8F%A3_-_Doorway_of_Cangjie_Tomb.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6e/%E4%BB%93%E9%A2%89%E5%A2%93%E9%97%A8%E5%8F%A3_-_Doorway_of_Cangjie_Tomb.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"WaitinZ","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​仓颉墓门口","width":320,"height":427}}